  "description": "Redis transport provider for kdyf.Notifications system. Enables distributed, persistent notification delivery using Redis Streams with fire-and-forget background processing. Features include: configurable storage strategies (standard key-value, updateable, stream-only), per-type stream routing, automatic stream trimming with TTL, resilience with retry policies, health checks for connection monitoring, backpressure control, and horizontal scalability. Requires kdyf.Notifications base package.",
